  - message: Ahmm...
    isPlayer: 1
    replies:
    - replyText: I curse every one of you who created this!
      nextNode: 5
    - replyText: ' I don''t want to play anymore. I can''t take it anymore. I can''t
        bear this anymore.'
      nextNode: 6
    nextNode: 0
  - message: Whatever you choose, in the end, it's your own choice.
    isPlayer: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 0
  - message: Calm down.
    isPlayer: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 7
  - message: You just have to find the pieces of paper with numbers on them
    isPlayer: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 8
  - message: and look at them in ascending order, all four of them.
    isPlayer: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 9
  - message: But be careful, don't look at anything you shouldn't
    isPlayer: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 10
  - message: and don't get the order wrong. 9:00 PM - 9:40 PM. This night is really
